WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.105 --> 01:44.105
Come in.

3
01:47.825 --> 01:51.025
Mr. Li, the advisor asked me to bring this to you.

4
01:52.225 --> 01:53.345
Thank you.

5
01:53.985 --> 01:54.825
Zheng Yu.

6
01:58.345 --> 02:01.385
I know you and Yanzhou are good friends.

7
02:01.465 --> 02:02.705
Can you talk to him?

8
02:03.505 --> 02:06.065
Well, there's a research institute in Germany

9
02:06.145 --> 02:08.665
working on a cancer cell research project.

10
02:08.744 --> 02:12.265
They've opened internship positions to college students worldwide.

11
02:13.345 --> 02:15.065
I think he should give it a try.

12
02:16.425 --> 02:18.305
You should talk to him about it.

13
02:19.625 --> 02:21.625
I couldn't get through to him.

14
02:22.225 --> 02:23.425
He didn't agree to it?

15
02:25.585 --> 02:26.625
That's normal.

16
02:26.705 --> 02:29.265
This doesn't align with his chosen area of research.

17
02:33.265 --> 02:34.345
However,

18
02:35.585 --> 02:36.745
he's still young

19
02:37.345 --> 02:39.705
and doesn't know that he has other options.

20
02:42.425 --> 02:43.705
Mr. Li,

21
02:43.785 --> 02:46.865
as his friend, I think I should respect his opinion.

22
02:49.065 --> 02:50.105
Okay.

23
02:54.185 --> 02:57.025
There are three common methods for separating plasmid DNA.

24
02:57.105 --> 02:58.425
The alkaline lysis method,

25
02:58.505 --> 02:59.825
the boiling lysis method,

26
03:01.425 --> 03:03.065
and the detergent lysis method.

27
03:03.145 --> 03:04.225
That's about it.

28
03:41.025 --> 03:41.905
What is it?

29
03:43.465 --> 03:44.665
Nothing.

30
03:44.745 --> 03:45.945
I just thought

31
03:46.025 --> 03:47.545
you looked like a teacher.

32
03:47.625 --> 03:48.865
No, wait.

33
03:48.945 --> 03:50.265
You are a teacher.

34
03:51.505 --> 03:52.545
Ms. Zheng.

35
03:55.065 --> 03:57.745
Are you done cleaning up? Do you have time for jokes?

36
03:59.065 --> 04:00.745
Ms. Zheng,

37
04:00.825 --> 04:01.905
I'll be done soon.

38
04:05.905 --> 04:06.945
Chen Yanzhou,

39
04:07.025 --> 04:09.065
Fu Yu is looking for you outside.

40
04:09.665 --> 04:10.505
Okay.

41
04:11.585 --> 04:12.785
I'm stepping out.

42
04:20.345 --> 04:21.905
Why is Fu Yu here?

43
04:21.985 --> 04:23.585
I heard she's pursuing Yanzhou.

44
04:24.785 --> 04:26.105
Isn't she going abroad?

45
04:26.185 --> 04:27.705
Why pursue anyone?

46
04:27.785 --> 04:28.745
In our field,

47
04:28.825 --> 04:30.345
plenty of people study abroad.

48
04:30.425 --> 04:32.665
Chen Yanzhou will eventually go abroad too.

49
04:32.745 --> 04:34.905
They seem like a good match.

50
04:34.985 --> 04:36.385
I'm hungry. Let's go eat.

51
04:36.465 --> 04:37.305
Sure.

52
04:40.465 --> 04:41.665
DUAN SHENGYANG

53
04:48.945 --> 04:50.785
Hello, Shengyang.

54
05:05.825 --> 05:06.665
Where is she?

55
05:12.345 --> 05:13.265
Shengyang.

56
05:13.945 --> 05:15.105
There you are. Come on.

57
05:15.185 --> 05:16.265
Let's eat first.

58
05:16.345 --> 05:18.065
No, thanks. What is this about?

59
05:18.745 --> 05:21.145
I'm starving after my group meeting.

60
05:21.985 --> 05:23.265
I've got my boss's card.

61
05:23.345 --> 05:25.545
He doesn't hand it over often. Let's feast.

62
05:33.225 --> 05:34.385
What would you like?

63
05:34.465 --> 05:35.305
Noodles.

64
05:37.905 --> 05:39.145
Find a place to sit.

65
05:39.225 --> 05:40.905
I'll order and find you later.

66
05:45.665 --> 05:47.545
Hi, two noodles.

67
05:47.625 --> 05:50.345
Plus two ribs and two eggs.

68
05:50.425 --> 05:51.745
Two ribs and two eggs.

69
05:52.545 --> 05:53.665
NAME: DUAN SHENGYANG

70
05:58.225 --> 05:59.865
We haven't done this in so long.

71
06:00.865 --> 06:02.465
Have you recovered?

72
06:04.585 --> 06:05.825
By the way,

73
06:05.905 --> 06:08.825
Ms. Cheng is no longer advising undergraduates,

74
06:08.905 --> 06:11.105
or you could have chosen her.

75
06:11.185 --> 06:12.425
Fu Yu,

76
06:12.505 --> 06:14.625
just say what is on your mind.

77
06:15.185 --> 06:16.425
Zheng Yu.

78
06:17.945 --> 06:19.945
We've been friends for nearly two years,

79
06:20.025 --> 06:22.265
but I just realized when ordering

80
06:22.345 --> 06:25.025
that I don't know your food preferences.

81
06:25.105 --> 06:25.945
I'm not picky.

82
06:28.425 --> 06:30.385
My study abroad plans are set.

83
06:30.465 --> 06:32.425
I'll go check out housing in advance.

84
06:32.505 --> 06:36.905
After all, finding a nice place to live isn't easy.

85
06:43.145 --> 06:45.985
Wasn't that girl your partner in the Excellence Cup?

86
06:51.065 --> 06:53.665
-Is that her boyfriend? -No.

87
06:54.785 --> 06:57.465
He's probably from the College of Foreign Languages.

88
06:57.545 --> 07:00.145
She occasionally takes translation gigs.

89
07:02.385 --> 07:03.905
You two sound close.

90
07:05.705 --> 07:06.985
When did you get so nosy?

91
07:07.065 --> 07:08.625
I've always been nosy.

92
07:09.545 --> 07:12.745
I remember when you first joined Ms. Cheng's lab.

93
07:12.825 --> 07:17.505
Gosh, hordes of underclassmen came to the lab to apply to do odd jobs.

94
07:18.225 --> 07:20.825
Unfortunately, you have a heart of iron.

95
07:21.945 --> 07:24.345
Nobody could survive your ice-cold attitude.

96
07:26.425 --> 07:28.585
So we already agreed.

97
07:29.345 --> 07:31.025
Don't go back on your word.

98
07:31.105 --> 07:32.025
Come on Thursday.

99
07:46.465 --> 07:48.545
Slow down. I haven't started talking yet.

100
07:49.745 --> 07:52.705
-Go on. -I have good news.

101
07:52.785 --> 07:54.945
Our boss, Professor Qiu Xingping,

102
07:55.665 --> 07:57.425
might contact you soon.

103
07:57.505 --> 08:00.105
We're short-staffed for a lab project.

104
08:00.185 --> 08:01.105
I recommended you.

105
08:01.185 --> 08:03.465
He knows you won the grand prize in the Excellence Cup.

106
08:03.545 --> 08:05.385
He's very interested in you.

107
08:05.465 --> 08:06.945
What is the research topic?

108
08:07.025 --> 08:07.865
I've emailed you.

109
08:12.545 --> 08:14.945
Just the basics. I can't send you the rest yet.

110
08:15.665 --> 08:19.545
Two juniors were working on it, but they haven't gotten anywhere.

111
08:20.225 --> 08:22.265
Our boss is very strict.

112
08:22.345 --> 08:25.465
One of the juniors caved under the pressure and quit.

113
08:25.545 --> 08:26.545
We're short-staffed.

114
08:27.345 --> 08:28.825
Don't worry.

115
08:28.905 --> 08:30.145
If you do take over,

116
08:30.225 --> 08:33.185
you gain experience, whether you publish a paper or not.

117
08:33.904 --> 08:35.264
I'm not worried.

118
08:35.345 --> 08:37.705
We have to choose an advisor this semester.

119
08:37.784 --> 08:41.065
It's worth treating as a graduation thesis.

120
08:43.865 --> 08:46.665
Still, thank you for telling me this in advance

121
08:46.745 --> 08:49.705
and looking out for opportunities over the past two years.

122
08:50.505 --> 08:52.865
It's nothing. Things are tough for you.

123
08:57.105 --> 08:59.705
A classmate went to this year's charity bazaar.

124
09:00.465 --> 09:02.985
I never dreamed your situation was like that.

125
09:06.145 --> 09:08.625
If you have any problems, come to me. I can help.

126
09:10.225 --> 09:11.665
I can handle it myself.

127
09:31.705 --> 09:33.545
I guessed you might be here.

128
09:35.265 --> 09:37.385
I'm helping a client with their homework.

129
09:38.225 --> 09:39.825
My laptop is too slow.

130
09:39.905 --> 09:42.265
Why did you leave so quickly after eating lunch?

131
09:42.345 --> 09:43.865
You were gone in a blink.

132
09:43.945 --> 09:45.705
I'm in a rush to get this done.

133
09:48.745 --> 09:50.305
So I was right.

134
09:50.385 --> 09:51.625
You did see me.

135
09:53.105 --> 09:54.265
Why didn't you say hi?

136
09:54.865 --> 09:56.185
You seemed busy.

137
10:10.105 --> 10:11.025
Zheng Yu,

138
10:11.705 --> 10:12.585
something's wrong.

139
10:15.265 --> 10:16.505
How so?

140
10:17.585 --> 10:18.825
Why won't you look at me?

141
10:20.265 --> 10:21.665
Says who?

142
10:40.265 --> 10:43.025
The girl who had lunch with me was Fu Yu.

143
10:43.105 --> 10:44.905
She's in Ms. Cheng's lab.

144
10:44.985 --> 10:46.505
She got a nice offer

145
10:46.585 --> 10:48.105
and will study in the US soon.

146
10:49.385 --> 10:50.785
I owe her a favor,

147
10:50.865 --> 10:53.425
so I agreed to go to her celebration party tomorrow.

148
10:55.065 --> 10:56.025
What favor?

149
10:59.145 --> 11:00.065
She saved my life.

150
11:00.145 --> 11:01.385
The meeting is tomorrow.

151
11:01.465 --> 11:03.425
I'll do as much as I can today.

152
11:03.505 --> 11:05.985
I bet someone else is working harder than me.

153
11:06.065 --> 11:08.785
You're asking who it is? Who else could it be?

154
11:13.625 --> 11:14.785
Yanzhou.

155
11:15.425 --> 11:16.745
Yanzhou!

156
11:23.305 --> 11:24.225
Why are you so quiet?

157
11:26.105 --> 11:29.825
I only knew that you left the lab due to health reasons.

158
11:30.465 --> 11:33.305
I didn't realize it was so serious.

159
11:36.785 --> 11:39.105
There is still a lot you don't know about me.

160
11:41.025 --> 11:43.225
Then if there's a chance in the future,

161
11:43.865 --> 11:45.745
you can tell me more.

162
12:03.025 --> 12:03.905
All right.

163
12:28.665 --> 12:29.745
Thank you.

164
12:32.425 --> 12:33.985
Zheng Yu.

165
12:34.065 --> 12:36.345
What are you so happy about?

166
12:37.185 --> 12:38.025
Nothing.

167
12:39.585 --> 12:40.425
Nothing?

168
12:41.665 --> 12:42.745
Try this.

169
12:46.905 --> 12:48.185
Take more.

170
12:53.545 --> 12:55.465
"Qian Yiwen"?

171
12:55.545 --> 12:56.745
Who is that?

172
12:57.425 --> 12:58.665
A regular client of mine.

173
12:58.745 --> 13:00.705
I have to bring this to her tomorrow.

174
13:10.625 --> 13:12.745
I just finished here. I'm on my way now.

175
13:14.625 --> 13:16.825
Second floor, right-hand side, first room.

176
13:17.745 --> 13:19.305
Okay, got it.

177
13:23.025 --> 13:26.545
Let's congratulate Fu Yu on securing an acceptance offer!

178
13:26.625 --> 13:28.065
SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH SUPERSTAR!

179
13:28.145 --> 13:29.705
Thank you, everyone.

180
13:29.785 --> 13:32.945
Even as undergraduates, I knew this day would come for Fu Yu.

181
13:33.665 --> 13:35.105
That's why…

182
13:35.185 --> 13:37.105
-I prepared… -What is it?

183
13:37.185 --> 13:38.465
LIKE A RIVER SURGING EAST

184
13:40.505 --> 13:42.985
No, that's embarrassing! Put it away!

185
13:43.065 --> 13:44.785
-How is it embarrassing? -It is.

186
13:44.865 --> 13:47.265
We're your undergraduate classmates and labmates.

187
13:47.345 --> 13:49.025
We're all friends here.

188
13:49.105 --> 13:50.825
Then why wait? Let's get started!

189
13:51.545 --> 13:54.065
Wait. I'm waiting for one more person.

190
13:54.145 --> 13:55.425
-Who? -Who?

191
13:55.505 --> 13:56.545
-So important. -Right.

192
13:56.625 --> 13:58.025
They're here.

193
13:59.545 --> 14:00.465
Hello.

194
14:01.105 --> 14:02.385
Hello.

195
14:02.465 --> 14:03.785
Gu Minghan?

196
14:05.545 --> 14:06.385
Why are you here?

197
14:06.465 --> 14:09.065
Fu Yu, you're such a terrible friend.

198
14:09.145 --> 14:11.425
We had four years together as undergraduates

199
14:11.505 --> 14:13.225
and three years in the same lab.

200
14:13.305 --> 14:15.105
-Him? -Seven years of friendship.

201
14:15.185 --> 14:17.545
But she actually forgot to invite me.

202
14:18.545 --> 14:20.025
Fu Yu,

203
14:20.105 --> 14:21.625
did I slip your mind,

204
14:21.705 --> 14:23.465
or did you not intend to invite me?

205
14:24.145 --> 14:25.465
No.

206
14:26.745 --> 14:27.985
Sorry, there was traffic.

207
14:33.665 --> 14:35.025
Looks like

208
14:35.785 --> 14:36.745
it was a choice.

209
14:36.825 --> 14:39.905
Anyway, you're here already, so have a seat.

210
14:39.985 --> 14:41.385
-Come. -Come on, sit.

211
14:41.465 --> 14:43.065
Sit. I'll ask them for a chair.

212
14:43.145 --> 14:45.585
By the way, add another two dozen beers.

213
14:55.105 --> 14:56.985
I think this really suits you.

214
14:57.065 --> 14:58.665
-Right? -Yes. Where?

215
14:58.745 --> 15:00.025
Right…

216
15:00.105 --> 15:01.465
I printed your paper.

217
15:03.225 --> 15:05.065
I knew you were reliable.

218
15:05.145 --> 15:06.985
Calculate the total for the homework,

219
15:07.065 --> 15:09.225
delivery, and printing, and message me.

220
15:09.305 --> 15:10.545
Okay.

221
15:11.305 --> 15:14.065
Don't leave. We ordered too much food. Join us.

222
15:15.305 --> 15:16.545
No, thanks.

223
15:16.625 --> 15:18.665
These are all potential clients.

224
15:18.745 --> 15:21.385
Don't miss out on this opportunity.

225
15:26.145 --> 15:28.145
Waiter, add a place setting.

226
15:28.225 --> 15:29.465
Okay.

227
15:31.625 --> 15:33.305
Top schools seem out of reach,

228
15:33.385 --> 15:35.665
but ordinary schools might be unaffordable.

229
15:35.745 --> 15:37.825
Competition will be fierce for a full ride.

230
15:37.905 --> 15:40.905
Our school seems to be promoting a Sino-German collaboration.

231
15:41.505 --> 15:44.385
There's a grant to study in a master's program in Germany.

232
15:45.025 --> 15:46.985
Darn, I was born too early!

233
15:47.065 --> 15:47.985
I know, right?

234
15:48.065 --> 15:49.825
Why do you say that?

235
15:49.905 --> 15:52.425
Folks, let me state my personal stance.

236
15:52.505 --> 15:54.745
I'm not studying in Germany.

237
15:55.625 --> 15:58.025
-Good grief. -Do you get to be choosy?

238
15:58.625 --> 16:00.945
Fu Yu, don't worry. I won't defer another year.

239
16:01.025 --> 16:03.065
Taking an extra year isn't anything bad.

240
16:03.145 --> 16:05.825
Some people are perfectly fine after taking a year off.

241
16:09.665 --> 16:11.465
Some take time off for their health.

242
16:11.545 --> 16:12.865
But a deferral could be

243
16:12.945 --> 16:15.905
a sign of a problem with someone's capability and attitude.

244
16:15.985 --> 16:17.425
Here, Yanzhou.

245
16:21.785 --> 16:24.785
Yanzhou, why do you look so gloomy?

246
16:24.865 --> 16:26.265
Fu Yu was accepted.

247
16:26.345 --> 16:28.785
-Aren't you happy? -Gu Minghan.

248
16:28.865 --> 16:30.705
Yanzhou has a great poker face.

249
16:30.785 --> 16:32.705
That makes it hard to be friends,

250
16:32.785 --> 16:34.265
but it's perfect for a researcher.

251
16:34.345 --> 16:35.865
Yes, that's right.

252
16:35.945 --> 16:38.425
Back then, he was always in the lab

253
16:38.505 --> 16:40.145
and didn't hang out with us.

254
16:40.785 --> 16:42.625
It really annoyed me.

255
16:42.705 --> 16:43.905
But thinking back on it,

256
16:43.985 --> 16:46.865
I guess I was annoyed at myself, not him.

257
16:46.945 --> 16:49.065
You were annoyed at yourself!

258
16:50.065 --> 16:51.305
Come on, let's drink.

259
16:51.385 --> 16:53.265
-Okay, come on. -All right! Cheers!

260
16:53.345 --> 16:56.385
To these past few years of staying true to ourselves.

261
16:56.465 --> 16:57.305
-Yes! -Okay!

262
16:57.385 --> 16:58.225
-Cheers! -Cheers!

263
16:58.305 --> 17:00.985
Yanzhou got into the lab thanks to his brother.

264
17:01.065 --> 17:04.505
Of course he would be too ashamed to drink with us.

265
17:05.785 --> 17:08.145
Gu Minghan, mind your words.

266
17:08.224 --> 17:09.625
What's wrong?

267
17:09.704 --> 17:12.265
Wasn't Zhou Guanqi the reason that Ms. Cheng…

268
17:14.745 --> 17:16.985
treats Yanzhou so well?

269
17:17.065 --> 17:19.224
That's what is said in the forum. See for--

270
17:19.305 --> 17:22.825
If that were true, wouldn't she let him back into the lab?

271
17:23.944 --> 17:27.025
I suppose it's because he didn't get anywhere for three years.

272
17:27.105 --> 17:28.665
Did you come to cause trouble?

273
17:28.745 --> 17:31.345
-No. -Excuse me. I'm going to the restroom.

274
17:35.505 --> 17:36.825
Look at you.

275
17:38.265 --> 17:39.145
Guilty conscience.

276
17:39.225 --> 17:41.345
Just give it a rest.

277
17:48.505 --> 17:49.705
Yanzhou,

278
17:50.465 --> 17:51.905
I'm sorry.

279
17:53.145 --> 17:56.665
I know Gu Minghan had a problem with you back in the lab.

280
17:57.465 --> 18:00.225
His attitude has always been problematic.

281
18:00.305 --> 18:02.665
-So I didn't plan to invite him-- -It's fine.

282
18:05.665 --> 18:08.025
I just wanted a get-together before I left.

283
18:08.105 --> 18:09.465
I didn't expect…

284
18:09.545 --> 18:10.905
I'm the problem.

285
18:13.545 --> 18:16.265
In any case, congratulations, Fu Yu.

286
18:29.025 --> 18:30.505
I'm full. I'll get going.

287
18:31.385 --> 18:33.025
Do you have to be so transparent?

288
18:33.865 --> 18:35.145
Thank you.

289
18:35.865 --> 18:37.145
Go on.

290
18:41.545 --> 18:44.065
Coming from her, the words "thank you"

291
18:44.145 --> 18:45.225
sound so mushy.

292
18:45.825 --> 18:48.905
He looks down his nose at us.

293
18:48.985 --> 18:50.825
Why couldn't he return to the lab?

294
18:50.905 --> 18:53.385
Because Chen Yanzhou couldn't get anything done.

295
18:53.465 --> 18:55.465
He's already amazing for an undergrad.

296
18:55.545 --> 18:57.625
Come on, let's wash your face and sober up.

297
18:57.705 --> 18:59.465
-He thinks he's his brother. -Go on.

298
18:59.545 --> 19:02.625
Listen, I was in the same graduating class as his brother.

299
19:02.705 --> 19:05.945
Be it capability or EQ, his brother was far better than him.

300
19:06.865 --> 19:09.505
But his brother lost in one aspect.

301
19:09.585 --> 19:11.305
His fate.

302
19:11.385 --> 19:13.145
Just drop it already.

303
19:13.905 --> 19:17.505
Buddy, have you ever heard of vanishing twin syndrome?

304
19:17.585 --> 19:21.465
It's when two fetuses share a single circulatory system.

305
19:21.545 --> 19:23.945
The one that dies gets absorbed and replaced

306
19:24.025 --> 19:25.145
by the surviving one.

307
19:25.225 --> 19:27.385
Him! Why did he apply to Qing Yi University?

308
19:27.465 --> 19:28.705
Why study biology?

309
19:28.785 --> 19:30.785
And why join our lab?

310
19:30.865 --> 19:34.065
Because he is completely absorbing and replacing his brother.

311
19:34.145 --> 19:35.585
What is this nonsense?

312
19:35.665 --> 19:37.105
You don't get it.

313
19:37.185 --> 19:39.745
Everyone in our year knows.

314
19:39.825 --> 19:41.185
Zhou Guanqi

315
19:41.265 --> 19:43.505
died because of Chen Yanzhou.

316
19:45.065 --> 19:47.225
That's all I'll say. It's absolutely--

317
19:49.665 --> 19:50.745
What the hell!

318
19:52.305 --> 19:53.625
What are you doing?

319
19:53.705 --> 19:55.465
You want to leave after doing that?

320
19:55.545 --> 19:56.465
That's enough.

321
19:56.545 --> 19:57.985
Who are you?

322
20:00.945 --> 20:02.225
You again.

323
20:02.305 --> 20:03.625
You want to meddle?

324
20:03.705 --> 20:05.145
-Enough. -Enough, stop it.

325
20:05.225 --> 20:06.825
Don't throw a drunken fit.

326
20:06.905 --> 20:08.025
I…

327
20:08.105 --> 20:09.145
I'm not drunk.

328
20:09.945 --> 20:12.665
Fu Yu, it's good that you're here. Let me ask you.

329
20:12.745 --> 20:15.225
Why didn't you invite me to your celebration party?

330
20:15.305 --> 20:17.465
I've known her for seven years! Seven years!

331
20:17.545 --> 20:18.665
Sorry, that's my bad.

332
20:18.745 --> 20:21.225
I forgot. I'll order whatever you like, okay?

333
20:21.305 --> 20:23.825
-Yes, let's order more. -I don't want that.

334
20:23.905 --> 20:25.705
-Let's eat. Go. -She said she forgot.

335
20:25.785 --> 20:28.425
-What does she mean by that? -Yanzhou, I'm sorry.

336
20:57.345 --> 20:58.785
Your house is that way.

337
20:58.865 --> 21:00.465
I'm going back to campus.

338
21:01.265 --> 21:02.585
Zheng Yu.

339
21:07.905 --> 21:09.785
What happened just now?

340
21:12.985 --> 21:14.705
That person said the wrong thing.

341
21:16.665 --> 21:17.585
What did he say?

342
21:24.025 --> 21:25.745
I can guess even if you don't say.

343
21:28.065 --> 21:29.785
What he said

344
21:31.225 --> 21:32.785
is true.

345
21:46.505 --> 21:48.025
I already called a cab.

346
21:48.105 --> 21:49.425
It will be here soon.

347
21:50.585 --> 21:51.825
Yanzhou.

348
21:53.265 --> 21:54.745
I'll go with you.

349
22:07.025 --> 22:10.825
Are you ditching your research to come with me because it's my birthday?

350
22:12.425 --> 22:13.825
You're overthinking it.

351
22:13.905 --> 22:16.265
I would've come even if it wasn't your birthday.

352
22:16.345 --> 22:19.785
Think of it this way. I get to take a break thanks to you.

353
22:27.785 --> 22:29.345
It's a long drive.

354
22:29.425 --> 22:30.985
Why don't I quiz you?

355
22:32.745 --> 22:33.865
If you get it right,

356
22:33.945 --> 22:35.545
then when we get to the garden,

357
22:35.625 --> 22:39.025
I'll loudly call myself an idiot in front of all your classmates.

358
22:41.305 --> 22:42.145
Childish.

359
22:45.705 --> 22:46.545
What topic?

360
22:47.905 --> 22:48.865
Let me think.

361
22:50.865 --> 22:52.985
Cristiano Ronaldo's full name.

362
22:54.225 --> 22:55.545
I don't even like football.

363
23:03.505 --> 23:04.665
You can't look it up.

364
23:05.505 --> 23:06.505
Guanqi.

365
23:07.305 --> 23:08.185
Are you cheating?

366
23:09.825 --> 23:11.065
Guanqi!

367
23:12.385 --> 23:13.585
FIELD TRIP GROUP

368
23:13.665 --> 23:15.305
AN URGENT NOTICE FROM THE SCHOOL!

369
23:15.385 --> 23:17.345
DUE TO BAD WEATHER AND SAFETY CONCERNS,

370
23:17.425 --> 23:20.065
TODAY'S FIELD TRIP TO THE NANSHAN BOTANICAL GARDEN

371
23:20.145 --> 23:21.305
HAS BEEN CANCELED.

372
23:33.465 --> 23:37.385
Her child has been traumatized, but even though she's his mother,

373
23:37.465 --> 23:39.905
she has been hiding in her room for so long.

374
23:40.745 --> 23:43.265
What is up with that?

375
23:43.345 --> 23:44.305
Mom,

376
23:44.905 --> 23:46.145
Ailan

377
23:47.105 --> 23:48.985
has just laid Guanqi to rest.

378
23:50.305 --> 23:52.425
Ailan needs some time.

379
23:52.505 --> 23:54.385
What was she doing?

380
23:55.385 --> 23:58.985
She promised to take Yanzhou there.

381
23:59.065 --> 24:03.065
If she had gone, nothing would have happened to Xiaoqi.

382
24:03.985 --> 24:07.145
I will pretend I didn't hear that.

383
24:07.225 --> 24:09.905
It wasn't Ailan's fault.

384
24:09.985 --> 24:11.865
Then whose fault was it?

385
24:11.945 --> 24:13.225
Yanzhou's?

386
24:13.985 --> 24:16.265
If his mom hadn't let him down,

387
24:16.345 --> 24:17.665
he wouldn't have…

388
24:18.425 --> 24:19.985
No, Mom.

389
24:20.065 --> 24:21.665
It's not Yanzhou's fault.

390
24:21.745 --> 24:23.745
None of them are to blame.

391
24:23.825 --> 24:27.305
Even now, I still don't know how any of this happened.

392
24:31.905 --> 24:33.665
Huaguang,

393
24:33.745 --> 24:37.905
when I think about how young Xiaoqi was…

394
24:39.105 --> 24:43.745
Who can return Xiaoqi to us?

395
24:52.785 --> 24:54.265
At the time,

396
24:54.345 --> 24:57.065
everyone wanted to find someone to blame for the incident.

397
24:58.385 --> 25:01.745
So my grandma blamed my mom.

398
25:02.505 --> 25:04.105
My dad blamed the driver.

399
25:05.345 --> 25:06.785
My aunt went to the school

400
25:07.585 --> 25:09.985
and asked them why they sent the notice so late.

401
25:12.025 --> 25:13.785
And you

402
25:13.865 --> 25:14.745
blamed yourself.

403
25:21.585 --> 25:23.505
Do you know why Fu Yu

404
25:24.225 --> 25:25.705
looks out for me…

405
25:28.905 --> 25:31.505
and even invited me to her celebration party?

406
25:32.265 --> 25:33.265
Why?

407
25:36.705 --> 25:38.825
She and Guanqi were undergrad classmates.

408
25:39.465 --> 25:41.745
They knew each other for less than a year…

409
25:43.905 --> 25:45.345
but she liked him a lot.

410
25:47.065 --> 25:49.265
This is what she told me

411
25:49.345 --> 25:51.345
after I joined the lab.

412
25:51.425 --> 25:52.265
Her own words.

413
25:54.585 --> 25:55.865
Not just her.

414
25:56.905 --> 26:00.545
Whether it's Li Yanan or Professor Cheng,

415
26:00.625 --> 26:03.705
a large part of their tolerance and patience with me

416
26:03.785 --> 26:05.825
comes from the regret they feel about my brother.

417
26:07.625 --> 26:09.465
If even they are like this,

418
26:09.545 --> 26:11.665
it's even more so with my family.

419
26:13.465 --> 26:18.345
How can I compensate everyone for the loss of such a wonderful person?

420
26:19.585 --> 26:21.105
I don't know how.

421
26:25.865 --> 26:27.345
ELEGANT CHAMBER OF FRAGRANT ORCHIDS

422
26:27.425 --> 26:29.265
For example, I learned calligraphy.

423
26:29.345 --> 26:31.465
Many asked me why I chose the Zhao style.

424
26:31.545 --> 26:33.065
CHEN YANZHOU

425
26:35.105 --> 26:37.465
I remember Yanzhou was a picky eater as a child.

426
26:37.545 --> 26:40.345
He wouldn't even touch scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

427
26:40.945 --> 26:43.545
I'm allergic to eggs. I took some allergy meds for it recently.

428
26:44.145 --> 26:45.505
At your house last time,

429
26:45.585 --> 26:47.185
you seemed to love the scrambled eggs.

430
26:47.265 --> 26:49.745
-Favorite dish? -Scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

431
26:49.825 --> 26:50.825
Ms. Zhou,

432
26:50.905 --> 26:53.105
you usually say you don't like crowds.

433
26:53.185 --> 26:55.305
I'm used to calling my mother Ms. Zhou.

434
26:58.745 --> 26:59.665
You…

435
27:02.145 --> 27:03.785
That's why you majored in biology

436
27:03.865 --> 27:05.225
and joined the lab.

437
27:08.465 --> 27:09.945
I can't think of

438
27:10.025 --> 27:11.305
what else I can do.

439
27:16.545 --> 27:18.345
You're so awful to yourself.

440
27:21.545 --> 27:23.545
I'm perfectly fine, aren't I?

441
27:44.065 --> 27:46.025
My mom said

442
27:46.105 --> 27:48.465
people feel sorrow because of love.

443
27:52.785 --> 27:54.185
Chen Yanzhou,

444
27:55.385 --> 27:57.665
stop beating yourself up when you're sad.

445
27:58.745 --> 28:01.305
Doing so is a betrayal of that love.

446
28:34.585 --> 28:37.545
NANSHAN BOTANICAL GARDEN

447
28:39.745 --> 28:40.905
My mom said

448
28:41.745 --> 28:44.705
people feel sorrow because of love.

449
28:45.745 --> 28:47.105
Chen Yanzhou,

450
28:47.625 --> 28:50.585
stop beating yourself up when you're sad.

451
28:51.545 --> 28:53.665
Doing so is a betrayal of that love.

452
29:12.545 --> 29:13.425
Do you need something?

453
29:15.225 --> 29:16.265
It's hot.

454
29:16.345 --> 29:17.385
Thank you.

455
29:25.865 --> 29:27.585
What is so hard to say?

456
29:31.825 --> 29:33.225
Mr. Li,

457
29:33.305 --> 29:36.385
last time, you mentioned a research institute opportunity.

458
29:36.465 --> 29:39.545
What documents are needed to apply?

459
29:39.625 --> 29:42.385
Are you interested? What's your email address?

460
29:43.705 --> 29:44.585
Thank you.

461
29:44.665 --> 29:47.025
But it's not for me.

462
29:52.945 --> 29:53.905
For Chen Yanzhou?

463
29:55.705 --> 29:57.425
Last time, you said

464
29:57.505 --> 29:58.385
he was still young

465
29:58.465 --> 30:00.825
and didn't know that he had other options.

466
30:01.545 --> 30:03.185
I think

467
30:03.265 --> 30:05.865
I sort of understand what that means now.

468
30:10.225 --> 30:12.065
In your eyes,

469
30:12.145 --> 30:15.705
what was Chen Yanzhou like before?

470
30:24.425 --> 30:26.505
GAO XING

471
30:26.585 --> 30:27.785
INCOMING CALL, GAO XING

472
30:30.345 --> 30:32.585
-Help, it's an emergency. -What is it?

473
30:32.665 --> 30:35.065
Look at the math problems I sent you.

474
30:35.145 --> 30:36.865
Can you help me do them?

475
30:36.945 --> 30:39.865
I searched all morning and only found the answers.

476
30:39.945 --> 30:41.385
The work isn't shown.

477
30:47.825 --> 30:49.105
Stop wasting data.

478
30:49.185 --> 30:52.065
It's fine. I have unlimited data.

479
30:52.705 --> 30:55.305
Who gave you the guts to ask me to do your homework?

480
30:55.905 --> 30:57.025
Renminbi.

481
31:01.905 --> 31:03.945
RED PACKET

482
31:04.025 --> 31:05.945
You have 30 seconds to recall that.

483
31:06.625 --> 31:08.145
Help me out.

484
31:08.225 --> 31:09.305
Please.

485
31:09.385 --> 31:11.065
Twenty-five seconds.

486
31:11.145 --> 31:12.785
If you don't recall it,

487
31:12.865 --> 31:14.865
I'll send your mom a screenshot.

488
31:14.945 --> 31:18.225
GAO XING RECALLED A MESSAGE

489
31:30.025 --> 31:31.625
What's up?

490
31:31.705 --> 31:34.065
Stone-cold rejection.

491
31:34.145 --> 31:35.945
Who did you ask?

492
31:36.025 --> 31:37.065
My private tutor.

493
31:38.145 --> 31:40.545
No wonder. No teacher does homework for students.

494
31:41.345 --> 31:43.505
Mr. Huang has it out for me.

495
31:44.105 --> 31:45.385
This workbook's problems

496
31:45.465 --> 31:48.225
could be the hardest questions on a monthly exam.

497
31:48.305 --> 31:50.745
I haven't solved any after staring at it all day.

498
31:50.825 --> 31:51.945
Why pick on you?

499
31:52.705 --> 31:54.945
He thinks I'm holding back the class.

500
31:55.665 --> 31:56.625
Let me take a look.

501
31:57.545 --> 31:58.385
Forget it.

502
31:58.985 --> 32:00.465
Why? Afraid I can't solve any?

503
32:01.225 --> 32:02.105
You'll be stumped.

504
32:10.065 --> 32:12.385
Gao Xing, I'll show you where to look.

505
32:12.465 --> 32:13.745
Over there.

506
32:14.465 --> 32:16.065
I'll leave it here for you.

507
32:19.665 --> 32:21.305
YEAR 2, CLASS 8

508
32:41.385 --> 32:44.385
What are you looking at? I'm here to give you business.

509
32:44.465 --> 32:45.745
What subject?

510
32:45.825 --> 32:46.945
Math.

511
32:49.465 --> 32:51.465
Isn't your usual rate 50 yuan per subject?

512
32:51.545 --> 32:53.305
I'll pay you double.

513
32:54.505 --> 32:55.505
Triple is fine too.

514
32:58.865 --> 33:00.105
What's the matter?

515
33:00.185 --> 33:02.585
Don't tell me you want to help me for free.

516
33:05.505 --> 33:07.625
Does your private tutor know

517
33:07.705 --> 33:09.585
you're paying someone to do your work?

518
33:10.105 --> 33:11.705
How do you know I have a tutor?

519
33:15.745 --> 33:18.625
Did you secretly ask around about me?

520
33:27.305 --> 33:29.705
Don't leave. Let's talk it out.

521
33:32.105 --> 33:33.985
Where did you buy that?

522
33:34.665 --> 33:36.825
My tutor gave it to me.

523
33:36.905 --> 33:39.145
We picked them when we went to the beach.

524
33:41.985 --> 33:43.065
Quadruple.

525
33:43.705 --> 33:44.945
What?

526
33:45.025 --> 33:47.025
Quadruple the rate to do your homework.

527
33:47.625 --> 33:48.505
You…

528
33:50.345 --> 33:52.465
Fine, quadruple it is.

529
33:53.065 --> 33:55.505
Add me on WeChat. I'll send the deposit.

530
34:01.265 --> 34:02.865
Can you get it done this week?

531
34:04.265 --> 34:06.105
No. You have to wait in line.

532
34:07.545 --> 34:08.385
Wait in line?

533
34:08.465 --> 34:11.025
Haven't you ever heard that the customer is king?

534
34:11.105 --> 34:12.865
A customer who pays quadruple

535
34:12.945 --> 34:14.985
is practically a god.

536
34:15.065 --> 34:16.105
I'm talking to you.

537
34:16.185 --> 34:17.784
Are you listening?

538
34:23.784 --> 34:25.505
Are you three going out?

539
34:25.585 --> 34:28.225
No, all four of us are going out.

540
34:28.945 --> 34:31.744
Zheng Yu, are you joining Qiu Xingping's lab?

541
34:32.585 --> 34:33.625
You're well-informed.

542
34:34.425 --> 34:37.304
Linlin and I heard when we inquired about postgrad studies.

543
34:37.385 --> 34:38.304
So is it true?

544
34:39.665 --> 34:41.744
I received an email from the lab today.

545
34:42.665 --> 34:45.065
-Congratulations! -Congratulations!

546
34:45.145 --> 34:46.824
I'm not sure if it's a good thing.

547
34:46.905 --> 34:49.705
It's a difficult research topic.

548
34:49.784 --> 34:50.824
I hope it goes well.

549
34:51.625 --> 34:52.585
Who cares?

550
34:52.665 --> 34:54.465
Change is progress.

551
34:54.545 --> 34:55.665
Progress

552
34:55.744 --> 34:57.545
means we should celebrate.

553
34:57.625 --> 34:58.985
So we plan to…

554
35:03.145 --> 35:04.185
Sorry, one moment.

555
35:06.985 --> 35:07.905
Hello?

556
35:09.745 --> 35:11.945
I'm at my dorm. Go ahead.

557
35:13.345 --> 35:15.345
Change the water for your thale cress?

558
35:16.305 --> 35:17.865
Is it just changing the water?

559
35:18.585 --> 35:20.305
Changing the water? Who is that?

560
35:21.425 --> 35:24.785
If my guess is correct, it should be Chen Yanzhou.

561
35:24.865 --> 35:26.305
Chen Yanzhou?

562
35:26.385 --> 35:29.385
Him again? He wouldn't even give me a bottle of water.

563
35:29.985 --> 35:32.665
I know. You've said it before.

564
35:32.745 --> 35:35.185
H… Have I?

565
35:35.265 --> 35:36.585
I can confirm. Twice now.

566
35:42.585 --> 35:44.025
It's nothing.

567
35:44.105 --> 35:46.305
I'll go right away. Don't worry.

568
35:47.465 --> 35:49.905
Where are you going? Aren't we going to celebrate?

569
35:50.785 --> 35:52.625
It's fine, Zheng Yu. Do your thing.

570
35:52.705 --> 35:54.545
We can celebrate later.

571
35:55.705 --> 35:57.185
Okay. My treat then.

572
36:31.065 --> 36:32.425
You lied to me.

573
36:32.505 --> 36:35.265
You asked me to change the water because you'd gone home.

574
36:37.025 --> 36:39.105
I just wanted to thank you in person.

575
36:39.185 --> 36:40.705
I forgot to say it last time.

576
36:42.065 --> 36:43.545
Thank you for comforting me.

577
36:46.705 --> 36:49.505
Besides, if I left, who would turn on the lights for you?

578
36:50.905 --> 36:52.625
I've been here many times.

579
36:52.705 --> 36:54.425
I'm familiar with the area now.

580
36:54.505 --> 36:55.745
I could still get there

581
36:56.345 --> 36:58.025
in the dark with my eyes closed.

582
37:02.785 --> 37:05.705
The lights seem to have heard your challenge.

583
37:13.545 --> 37:14.465
Whatever.

584
37:14.545 --> 37:16.105
It's one more set of stairs.

585
37:16.185 --> 37:17.945
I'll just feel my way in the dark.

586
37:27.705 --> 37:30.105
You said you could do it with your eyes closed.

587
37:30.185 --> 37:31.985
Don't forget

588
37:32.065 --> 37:33.425
to close your eyes.

589
37:44.185 --> 37:45.265
-Hello. -Hello.

590
37:45.345 --> 37:47.545
Your delivery has arrived outside Sixian Hall.

591
37:48.505 --> 37:51.465
Please tell the building manager that it's a bit heavy.

592
37:51.545 --> 37:53.025
Please help bring it upstairs.

593
37:53.105 --> 37:54.825
Just leave it outside Room 223.

594
37:54.905 --> 37:56.385
Thank you.

595
37:56.465 --> 37:58.705
What did you deliver to my dorm?

596
37:59.625 --> 38:00.705
Bottled water.

597
38:01.465 --> 38:02.305
Ten boxes.

598
38:06.665 --> 38:09.665
Fangli, why did you buy so much water?

599
38:09.745 --> 38:11.025
I didn't buy it.

600
38:12.105 --> 38:13.385
Then who did?

601
38:14.545 --> 38:16.865
The buyer's surname is Chen.

602
38:16.945 --> 38:20.105
I don't know any Chens.

603
38:21.505 --> 38:24.025
-Chen Yanzhou? -Chen Yanzhou?

604
38:24.105 --> 38:26.545
Wait. Why did he buy so much water?

605
38:26.625 --> 38:28.145
Is… Is he crazy?

606
38:29.665 --> 38:30.705
I…

607
38:31.585 --> 38:32.825
think…

608
38:33.705 --> 38:35.105
I probably

609
38:35.185 --> 38:36.185
know why.

610
38:36.265 --> 38:37.105
Why…

611
38:37.185 --> 38:38.225
I think I know too.

612
38:39.585 --> 38:41.265
Have you ever heard of a tactic

613
38:41.345 --> 38:43.145
called the pacification strategy?

614
38:43.825 --> 38:45.265
It's using peaceful measures

615
38:45.345 --> 38:48.345
to persuade the opposing party to support you.

616
38:49.545 --> 38:50.705
Simply put,

617
38:50.785 --> 38:52.705
there's no such thing as a free lunch.

618
38:52.785 --> 38:53.705
Wait.

619
38:53.785 --> 38:56.025
Why are you two speaking in riddles?

620
39:02.185 --> 39:03.385
What?

621
39:03.465 --> 39:04.745
Zheng Yu and Chen Yanzhou?

622
39:08.265 --> 39:10.825
Ten boxes? Isn't that a bit excessive?

623
39:12.065 --> 39:13.185
Not at all.

624
39:13.265 --> 39:14.585
I just hope your roommates

625
39:14.665 --> 39:16.705
will stop saying bad things about me,

626
39:16.785 --> 39:18.145
especially in front of you.

627
39:22.145 --> 39:23.425
Let's go change the water.

628
39:26.625 --> 39:29.505
Why not change it tomorrow? It's just a few more hours.

629
39:31.905 --> 39:33.985
I have something important to do tomorrow.

630
39:38.345 --> 39:39.425
Let's go.

631
39:53.305 --> 39:54.385
Zheng Yu, right?

632
39:55.145 --> 39:56.345
-Professor Qiu. -Come.

633
39:56.425 --> 39:57.705
Let's go to the lab first.

634
39:59.305 --> 40:01.785
Have you worked in another lab before?

635
40:01.865 --> 40:02.985
No.

636
40:03.065 --> 40:05.545
That's okay. There's a first time for everything.

637
40:05.625 --> 40:08.345
I've arranged for a second-year master's student to guide you.

638
40:08.425 --> 40:09.265
Of course,

639
40:09.345 --> 40:12.585
you can also seek advice from other upperclassmen.

640
40:12.665 --> 40:14.185
Once you've found your feet,

641
40:14.265 --> 40:17.345
you can start doing research with the other two undergraduates.

642
40:17.425 --> 40:18.265
Two?

643
40:18.345 --> 40:21.585
But Shengyang told me that one of them dropped out.

644
40:21.665 --> 40:22.665
Yes, they did.

645
40:22.745 --> 40:25.025
But I found someone else in your major.

646
40:25.545 --> 40:26.665
A three-person team

647
40:26.745 --> 40:28.585
makes things less stressful.

648
40:29.425 --> 40:31.465
You should be familiar with this student.

649
40:32.305 --> 40:34.385
I'm not familiar with many students.

650
40:44.465 --> 40:47.225
These two are new additions to our lab.

651
40:47.945 --> 40:50.105
Chen Yanzhou and Zheng Yu.

652
40:51.985 --> 40:53.625
Fangyi, take good care of them.

653
40:53.705 --> 40:55.465
Okay.

654
40:55.545 --> 40:57.305
Okay, I won't take up your time.

655
40:57.945 --> 41:00.025
When you have time, exchange WeChat info.

656
41:00.105 --> 41:01.305
Get to know each other.

657
41:01.985 --> 41:04.785
Also, if you have any questions, you can come to me now.

658
41:04.865 --> 41:06.305
I won't be here long.

659
41:07.025 --> 41:08.345
Just for one hour.

660
41:10.985 --> 41:12.265
I'm Zhong Fangyi.

661
41:13.105 --> 41:15.265
Your workspace is over there.

662
41:16.305 --> 41:17.665
That guy is Bi Dezheng.

663
41:17.745 --> 41:19.105
He will be your research partner.

664
41:19.785 --> 41:22.345
He and another student started on it sophomore year.

665
41:22.425 --> 41:23.905
Now he's the only one left.

666
41:24.505 --> 41:26.465
You can find me at my workspace here.

667
41:30.545 --> 41:31.705
Let's go.

668
41:37.945 --> 41:39.345
This is…

669
41:44.225 --> 41:47.185
Can't you see I'm having a moment of silence

670
41:47.265 --> 41:48.465
for the baby bacteria?

671
41:49.065 --> 41:51.745
Baby bacteria?

672
41:58.465 --> 41:59.985
Five minutes.

673
42:00.065 --> 42:00.905
It's about time.

674
42:01.585 --> 42:02.825
Family and friends,

675
42:02.905 --> 42:04.185
take a step back.

676
42:05.225 --> 42:06.465
I understand.

677
42:06.545 --> 42:07.865
I know.

678
42:07.945 --> 42:09.625
I get it.

679
42:12.825 --> 42:13.865
Sit.

680
42:16.025 --> 42:17.145
Sit.

681
42:25.185 --> 42:26.465
Care for coffee?

682
42:32.465 --> 42:33.305
Restroom break?

683
42:36.625 --> 42:37.745
Then I'll go.

684
42:58.505 --> 43:00.185
Does everyone end up like that

685
43:00.865 --> 43:02.185
after too long in the lab?

686
43:03.065 --> 43:04.705
It depends on the person.

687
43:04.785 --> 43:07.585
At least, I can't imagine you doing this kind of thing.

688
43:13.425 --> 43:15.585
By the way, why are you--

689
43:15.665 --> 43:16.825
Zheng Yu.

690
43:25.345 --> 43:26.705
Research materials for you.

691
43:26.785 --> 43:28.345
The screen is hard on the eyes,

692
43:28.425 --> 43:32.545
so I went to print it for you and ended up coming back too late to welcome you.

693
43:33.305 --> 43:34.305
You didn't have to.

694
43:35.185 --> 43:37.705
I already printed it. It will be a waste not to use it.

695
43:40.305 --> 43:42.665
Come find me if you ever need anything.

696
43:42.745 --> 43:43.585
Wait.

697
43:44.185 --> 43:45.785
I do have a question.

698
43:47.425 --> 43:49.865
Then let's go to the break room.

699
43:54.625 --> 43:57.305
Wasn't that girl your partner in the Excellence Cup?

700
43:57.385 --> 43:59.345
-Is that her boyfriend? -No.

701
44:00.385 --> 44:02.745
He's probably from the College of Foreign Languages.

702
44:03.385 --> 44:05.625
So he's not from the College of Foreign Languages.
